---
/** First focusable element on every page (§7.4). Visible on focus only. */
---

<a
	href="#main"
	class="absolute left-1/2 top-0 z-(--z-skip) -translate-x-1/2 translate-y-[-120%] rounded-b-card border border-accent bg-surface-2 flex min-h-11 items-center px-5 py-3 font-mono text-label tracking-[0.14em] text-accent uppercase no-underline transition-transform duration-(--duration-fast) ease-ui focus-visible:translate-y-0"
>
	Skip to content
</a>
